BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0a341792-2f84-3a94-a5df-f36799a8bc28.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
